"P506962844" "Emperor Cole's army was divided after news of his bargain with Hamidon was spread by TPN. Many members of the IDF defected and joined the Resistance, realizing that Calvin Scott was right all along. These soldiers now believe in the cause of Calvin Scott, even if they do not believe directly in the man himself."
// DisplayNames :
"P3316237524" "Defected Trooper"

