// Villain Def - UnifiedPeoplesArmy_FieldOfficer_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4200994262" "Officers are veteran soldiers who have years of command experience. They use their leadership skills to hone the resistance fighters under their command into a deadly fighting force whether they are raw recruits, or elite commandos. They also pack the best weapons they can get their hands on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - UnifiedPeoplesArmy_Infiltrator_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1843459008" "The Infiltrators are elite assassins, drawn from the ranks of both Loyalist and Resistance. They are fanatically devoted to Calvin Scott and his mission. They are equipped with advanced targeting computers that allow them to update combat assessments in real time, improving the effectiveness of their attacks and those of their allies. Infiltrators are both willing and able to take as many lives as possible in the name of bringing about their vision of the world."
// DisplayNames :
"P986320000" "Infiltrator"

