"P919718653" "Armed with plasma weaponry capable of piercing through the toughest of armor, these turrets are an incredibly effective deterrent for keeping trespassers out of the Lambda sector and other vital Praetorian military outposts. The Unified People's Army make full use of these turrets to take out any foes that wander into their vital areas."
